# Forget Me Not — Phase 3 Component Library Rules

## 1. Source of Truth

Component rules:

`docs/phase3-component-library.md`

Inherited foundation:

`docs/component-library.md`

Visual rules:

`docs/phase3-design-system.md`

Product rules:

`docs/phase3-product.md`

Locked decisions:

`docs/phase3-decisions.md`

Do not duplicate detailed component specifications here.

---

## 2. Component Architecture

```text
Foundation → Composite → Business Component → Page Module → Page
```

Do not place page-level business logic in lower-level components.

---

## 3. Hard Rules

### Rule 1 — Reuse Before Create

```text
Reuse → Compose → Variant → New Component
```

Do not create duplicate components with different names.

### Rule 2 — No AI-Specific Components

Do not create:

```text
AIButton
AIInput
AIItemCard
AITripCard
AIConfirmDialog
AIPrice
```

unless the new component has a genuinely different responsibility.

### Rule 3 — Component Responsibility Boundary

Components may own:

* presentation
* component-level interaction
* meaningful local state
* meaningful variants

Components must not own:

* Agent planning
* Workflow routing
* business-rule decisions
* permission decisions
* database persistence
* product decisions
* unrelated page logic

### Rule 4 — Logic Separation

```text
UI Component
↓
Page / Application Layer
↓
Workflow / Business Logic
↓
Tool / Data Operation
↓
FMN Data
```

Do not move business rules into UI components.

Do not move UI concerns into Workflow definitions.

### Rule 5 — Variant vs State

Variant:

> 不同稳定用途或展示类型。

State:

> 当前状态。

不要创建 Variant × State 的独立组件。

### Rule 6 — Public / Private via Variant

Prefer:

```text
TripCard
ItemCard
VisibilityBadge
```

rather than:

```text
PublicTripCard
PrivateTripCard
PublicItemCard
PrivateItemCard
```

Components display state; they do not decide validity.

### Rule 7 — Draft / Confirmation

Preserve:

```text
Draft → Review → Confirm → Formal Write
```

Components must not silently persist formal business data.

### Rule 8 — Explicit Confirm Semantics

Formal write requires an explicit Confirm Action.

NOT Confirm:

* passive viewing
* scrolling
* closing Companion
* "看起来不错" / "好的" / "嗯" / "继续"

Valid Confirm:

* explicit UI Confirm action
* explicit natural-language confirmation intent

### Rule 9 — Companion Component Boundary

Companion Components may display:

* user messages
* assistant responses
* structured results
* Drafts
* confirmations
* task progress

They must not implement:

* Agent Loop
* Tool Calling
* Workflow execution
* formal business-data writes

### Rule 10 — Result & Candidate Reuse

Prefer existing FMN components:

```text
Record Result  → Item / Record
Trip Result    → TripCard
Search Result  → SearchResultCard
Todo Result    → ShoppingTodoCard
Statistics     → Stat / Table
```

Do not create parallel result-card systems.

### Rule 11 — Todo Component Overrides

Phase 3 overrides:

* ShoppingTodoCard
* ShoppingTodoButton
* PurchaseConversion

Use:

```text
Product
reference_price
reference_currency
reference_location
Quantity
Category
Note
Todo Status
```

Do not use:

```text
ReferencePrice
ReferenceLocation
SourceInfo
```

ShoppingTodoButton must not bypass Formal Todo Requirements.

PurchaseConversion must preserve Quantity.

PurchaseConversion location inheritance:

```text
reference_location（计划购买地点）
        ↓
作为建议值预填
        ↓
用户确认 / 修改
        ↓
purchase_location（实际购买地点）
```

### Rule 12 — Todo Required Fields

Phase 3 New Todo Draft must contain:

* Trip
* Product
* reference_price
* reference_currency
* reference_location

缺任何一个：

> 不进入 Confirm。

Validation is enforced by Workflow / Application Layer.

Components only reflect validation state.

### Rule 13 — Legacy Todo Exception

Legacy Todo：

* 不强制补齐
* 可 View / Delete / Convert
* 转换时按 Phase 3 Conversion Rules 处理

不得因 Phase 3 Required Fields 对 Legacy Todo：

* 显示错误状态
* 强制补齐
* 阻塞转换

### Rule 14 — BatchDraft Boundary

BatchDraft 组织多个 DraftCard + Unified Actions。

任一对象不完整时：

> 整个最终写入流程暂停。

不得部分正式写入。

Transaction boundary 由 Workflow / Application Layer 保证，Component 不负责实现 Transaction。

### Rule 15 — reference_location Semantics

```text
reference_location = 计划购买地点
purchase_location  = 实际购买地点
```

不得引入第二个独立字段。

Component 只负责展示与触发操作。

### Rule 16 — Receipt Component Boundary

ReceiptInput / RecordDraft：

* Receipt Image 是共享输入，可关联多个 Record
* 未 Confirm 的 Receipt Image 属于 Temporary Receipt Asset
* Temporary Receipt 不创建正式 receipts record
* Confirm 后由 Workflow 创建 receipts + receipt_items

Component 不负责：

* OCR
* Product Splitting
* Receipt → Item 关联写入
* Temporary / Formal Receipt 生命周期管理

### Rule 17 — Naming

Use clear PascalCase names.

Prefer:

```text
CompanionSurface
AssistantMessage
RecordDraft
TodoDraft
ConfirmationCard
TaskProgress
CandidateSelector
```

Avoid:

```text
Box / Block / Panel1 / ComponentA
AIThing
ThailandTripCard / PinkProductCard
```

### Rule 18 — State Coverage

Define only states that are genuinely required.

Common states:

```text
Default / Hover / Pressed / Focus
Loading / Processing / Waiting / Disabled
Error / Selected / Completed / Cancelled
```

Do not add states merely for completeness.

### Rule 19 — Future Components

Documentation does not authorize implementation.

Only implement components required by the current Phase 3 task.

### Rule 20 — Change Discipline

Before modifying a shared component:

* inspect current usages
* preserve valid behavior
* prefer compatible changes
* avoid unrelated refactoring
* update affected usages when necessary

Do not rewrite a shared component merely to simplify one page.

---

## 4. Product / Design / Component Boundary

```text
phase3-product.md
        ↓
phase3-design-system.md
        ↓
phase3-component-library.md
```

Product → What.

Design → How it looks.

Component Library → Which reusable components.

Do not use component convenience to change product behavior.

---

## Final Principle

> **Reuse before creating.**

> **Compose before duplicating.**

> **Variant before creating a new component.**

> **Keep Product, Business Logic, Workflow, and Presentation separate.**

> **Build only the components required by the current Phase 3 task.**
